# exp001-05, -06
memory bug investigation
Heap exhaustion was not observed. 
Failures were Stack canary watchpoint triggered (loopTask), 
sometimes on the first sequence after boot. 
Diagnostic runs showed stack margin as low as 44 words, 
The issue is therefore most likely stack exhaustion or stack corruption in the analyzer sequence/reset path.
